# no secrets live in this project by design
# BYOK credentials arrive through Anna's credential injection
# the tool declares its keys in describe and receives them per invoke
# nothing else is required
#
# local development reads keys from the environment as a fallback only:
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#   GOOGLE_API_KEY=
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
#   XAI_API_KEY=
#   MISTRAL_API_KEY=
#   GROQ_API_KEY=
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
#
# never commit a real value
